  "ruleText": "Lan 304.05 Certificate of Authorization Renewal Fee. The annual renewal fee for proprietorships shall be $50.00, and $75.00 for partnerships or corporations.\n\nSource. #5934, eff 12-9-94; ss by #6929-B, 1-12-99; ss by #7950, eff 9-10-03; ss by #9340, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12031, eff 11-1-16 (from Lan 304.06)",
